# Project memories

Do not re-derive a known answer. **Read [`.cursor/memory/MEMORY.md`](../memory/MEMORY.md) first**, then open every linked file whose title matches the task.

Those files are the project memory store: traps, tenant policies, deploy mechanics, and feedback. The index is the lookup; the linked file is the source. If you find yourself re-deriving something a memory already covers, update that memory file rather than leaving the new answer only in chat. Both Cursor and Claude Code read and write here.
